# Cancel this ordinary utterance ID at its Agent or TTS owner.
# Agent fences queued/in-flight publication; TTS fences pending/late playback.
# A valid unseen ID reserves cancellation; recent 256 IDs are retained.
string request_id
---
# Acceptance records cancellation, not physical TTS playback completion.
bool accepted
# TTS only: this cancelled request has no remaining playback/cleanup work.
# Agent leaves false. Unknown/failed cleanup must never report quiescent=true.
bool quiescent
